# Brigands Sweep (Q292): a dwarven fighter of level 5 accepts at Spiron. Balanki has nothing to buy
# yet. Eight goblin brigands give eight necklaces, a brigand leader a pendant and a goblin lord a lord
# pendant (each roll pinned to 9, over 5); Spiron pays 12, 36 and 33 for them, with 1000 more for ten.
# A roll of 5 gives a suspicious memo instead: one memo and a necklace are paid on the one-memo page,
# two on the two-memo page; the third memo becomes a suspicious contract, which Balanki buys for 1500.
# Three more memos give another contract, which Spiron buys with the necklaces for 1120 more on the
# contract page; then the player quits the repeatable quest; then relog. Expectations replay the
# reference trace of this scenario.
trace internal/gameserver/script/testdata/oracle/scenarios/q292_brigands_sweep.golden
character Sweeper 5
class 53
random 9 0 9 0 9 0 9 0 9 0 9 0 9 0 9 0 9 0 9 0 5 0 9 0 5 0 9 0 5 0 5 0 5 0 5 0 9 0
script quest.Q292_BrigandsSweep
item 1483 1484 1485 1486 1487
page default/30532.htm
page default/30533.htm
page script/quest/Q292_BrigandsSweep/
npc spiron 30532 Folk 10 0 0
npc balanki 30533 Folk -10 0 0
npc brigand 20322 Monster 40 0 0
npc leader 20323 Monster 0 40 0
npc lord 20528 Monster 0 -40 0

# Spiron: accept.
action spiron
action spiron
  S ActionFailed
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=spiron item=0 page=default/30532.htm
  S ActionFailed
