  Q upsert Q292_BrigandsSweep | <state> | STARTED
  Q upsert Q292_BrigandsSweep | <cond> | 1
  state Q292_BrigandsSweep STARTED
  rows Q292_BrigandsSweep <cond>=1 <state>=STARTED

